@startuml overview
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor Maintainer

package "product repository" {
  file "docs/ja/requirements/*.md\n(source of truth)" as docs
  file "tracker settings\n(TOML)" as settings
}

package "GitHub" {
  rectangle "requirement issues" as req
  rectangle "implementation issues\n(sub-issues)" as impl
  rectangle "pull requests" as pr
}

package "cumin-trace" {
  rectangle "templates and skill" as tpl
  rectangle "check" as check
  rectangle "export\n(requirements.json)" as export
  rectangle "trace\n(read only)" as trace
  rectangle "site and dashboard\n(Starlight, static)" as site
}

Maintainer --> tpl : write with
tpl --> docs : new documents, next ID
docs --> check
settings --> check
check --> export
export --> trace
req --> trace : IDs in the body
impl --> trace : state
pr --> trace : merged or not
req -- impl
impl -- pr
export --> site
trace --> site
docs --> site
site --> Maintainer : whole picture, progress

@enduml
